 X("D-23","Security","Inventory.purchase action split","One action gates a PO draft, a goods receipt (creates stock) and a PO-to-invoice conversion (accounting effect) - three impact classes, one permission code.","A) keep closed whole; B) split into three codes; C) split into two","B eventually - the single code cannot express three impacts. Kept closed whole for now, with the VOCABULARY DEFECT reason pinned by test so the decision cannot be reversed silently.","Permission vocabulary.","R6, R9","Owner","R6 entry","OPEN - closed whole for now"),
 X("D-27","Platform","AI governance","AiService and AiInsightsService exist with NO AI-specific authorization, behind a context that still has 143 unprotected actions.","A) governed dataset-only access; B) full read; C) disable until governed","A - AI reads the reporting dataset layer, never raw tables.","Gates all AI work.","R12","Owner","R12 entry","OPEN"),
 X("D-28","Platform","Search ownership","No search implementation exists; zero source files match.","A) platform-owned index; B) per-module search; C) external engine","A - one index that honours per-module authorization AT QUERY TIME, not by filtering after retrieval.","Gates search.","R12","Owner","R12 entry","OPEN"),
